BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: North Bay Contra Dance
UID:event_315262411@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260726T040712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T220000
SUMMARY: Switcheroo! Queer Contra 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay Contra Dance\n**Come one\, come all to the kickoff o
 f Switcheroo! A new queer contradance series host by NBCDS at Wischemann H
 all in Sebastopol.**\nThis is a new gender-free\, queer-normative contrada
 nce\, focusing on welcoming new dancers\, emphasizing consent and mutual c
 are\, and building an inclusive\, joyful\, and exuberant dance community h
 ere in the North Bay. This is not an exclusively queer event–Allies and 
 friends welcomed and encouraged! This is a family-friendly dance\, so brin
 g your kids!\n\n7:00-7:30 **Introductory lesson for new dancers (experienc
 ed dance angels encouraged!)**\n7:30-8:30 **Dancing Round 1**\n8:30-9:00 *
 *Snacking and schmoozing (Potluck snacks–bring a tasty treat to share if
  you like!)**\n9:00-10:00 **Dancing Round 2**\n\n$5-20 Sliding Scale\, NOT
 AFLOF (No One Turned Away For Lack Of Funds)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-contra-dance/events/3152624
 11/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T001521Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T001521Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: North Bay Contra Dance
UID:event_314496957@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260726T040712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T160000
SUMMARY:English Country Dance Napa
DESCRIPTION:North Bay Contra Dance\nEnglish country dancing is done in lon
 g lines (like contra)\, circles\, or in geometric sets (squares\, triangle
 s). Like our contra dances\, there is live music and a caller. You can com
 e by yourself or with friends\, since we change partners after each dance.
  If you’ve ever done contra or square dancing\, much of our dance vocabu
 lary will be familiar to you since both of those styles evolved from Engli
 sh country dancing.\n\nThe dance is held the 1st and 3rd Sundays of each m
 onth\, 2-4:30 pm\, to live music\, all levels of experience welcome\; and 
 occasional 5th Sundays for Advanced dancers. Admission is $15 for members 
 of NBCDS and its affiliates\, $8 for young adults ages 19-30\, and $3 for 
 youth ages 6 – 18.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-contra-dance/events/3144969
 57/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260426T202158Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260426T202158Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
